# Her everyday answers: on everyday.
# Conversation.Everyday.cs sets s (which answer), tone, and vmood, trep or secret where the answer depends on them.
# The whole context of the talk is there too, so a rule can be added for a personality, a relation or a mood.

# ================= a friend's hello, when what she heard needs no comment =================
@rule everyday.hello.gentle
on everyday
when s=hello tone=gentle
- Oh, hi! Do you have a minute?
- Oh, hi! Got a minute?
- Hello! Are you free?
- Ah, hi! Can we talk?
- Hello! It's nice to see you.
- Hello! Good to see you.
- Hi! I'm glad you came.
- Ah, hello! Nice to see you.
- Ah, hi! How are you doing?
- Hi! How are you?
- Ah, hello! Doing well?
- Hi! How's your day?

@rule everyday.hello.energetic
on everyday
when s=hello tone=energetic
- Yo! What's up?
- Yo! What's new?
- Hey! What's happening?
- Sup!
- Heeey! Perfect, I was bored!
- Heeey! I was so bored!
- Hi! Save me from boredom!
- Yay! Someone fun!
- Hey hey! Got something fun for me?
- Hey! Got something fun?
- Hey! Any news?
- Hi hi! Fun stuff?

@rule everyday.hello.cool
on everyday
when s=hello tone=cool
- Hey. What's going on?
- Hey. What's up?
- Hi. Something new?
- What's going on?
- Oh, it's you. Hi.
- Oh. Hi.
- Hello.
- It's you. Hello.
- Hi. Need something?
- Hi. Something you need?
- Hello. Yes?
- Need anything?

@rule everyday.hello.teasing
on everyday
when s=hello tone=teasing
- Well, well. Look who it is.
- Look who's here.
- Well, hello.
- Oh, it's you.
- Came to see me? Smart.
- Came to see me? Good call.
- Visiting me? Smart.
- Clever, coming here.
- Hi there. Entertain me.
- Hi. Amuse me.
- Hello. Impress me.
- Entertain me, please.

# ================= She has a story =================
@rule everyday.anecdote.gentle
on everyday
when s=anecdote tone=gentle
- This morning a little bird landed on my desk by the window. I didn't dare move all through first period.
- A bird landed on my desk this morning. I didn't move all period.
- A little sparrow visited my window today. I held my breath.
- A bird sat by me in class. I froze so it wouldn't leave.
- My little sister made me a bento with a face on it. I couldn't bring myself to eat the eyes.
- My sister made me a bento with a face. I couldn't eat the eyes.
- A smiley bento from my sister... too cute to eat.
- My sister drew a face on my rice... I couldn't eat it.
- I found a really good bookstore near the station. It smells like old paper. I could live there.
- There's a bookstore near the station... it smells like old paper.
- I found a cozy bookstore... I could stay forever.
- A little bookstore by the station... heaven.
- I've been practicing calligraphy. My characters still look like they're running away.
- My calligraphy characters look like they're fleeing...
- Practicing calligraphy... still messy.
- Calligraphy is hard... my strokes wobble.
- I fell asleep on the train and woke up three stations late. I had to run all the way here...
- I slept on the train and missed my stop... I had to run.
- Three stations too far... I ran all the way.
- I dozed off on the train... so late.
- The cherry tree behind the gym is starting to bud. I go look at it every morning.
- The cherry tree by the gym is budding... I visit every morning.
- The cherry buds are coming... I check daily.
- Spring's coming... the tree is budding.

@rule everyday.anecdote.energetic
on everyday
when s=anecdote tone=energetic
- I tried to jump the university fence this morning because I was late. Spoiler: the fence won.
- I tried jumping the fence when late. The fence won.
- Fence climb this morning! Fence: one, me: zero!
- Tried to vault the gate! Faceplant!
- I beat my high score in that rhythm game! My fingers still hurt!
- New high score in my rhythm game! Fingers hurt!
- Beat my record! My hands are dead!
- High score! Ouch, fingers!
- There's a new crepe stand near the park! I've already tried four flavors!
- New crepe stand by the park! Four flavors already!
- Crepes near the park! I tried them all!
- Crepe stand! Four down!
- Our club's practice match is coming up and I've been training every morning!
- Training every morning for our match!
- Practice match soon! Training hard!
- Morning drills! Match coming!
- My phone fell in the pool yesterday. I'm living like a caveman now!
- My phone fell in the pool! Caveman life!
- Phone in the pool! No tech!
- Dropped my phone in water! Disaster!
- I signed up to help at the campus festival! It's gonna be huge!
- I'm helping with the festival! Huge!
- Festival volunteer! So excited!
- Signed up for the festival! Big!

@rule everyday.anecdote.cool
on everyday
when s=anecdote tone=cool
- The vending machine gave me two drinks for the price of one today. I've decided it's a sign.
- Two drinks for one today. A sign.
- The vending machine glitched in my favor. A sign.
- Free drink. The universe approves.
- I finished a thousand-piece puzzle yesterday. One piece was missing. I'm still angry.
- Thousand-piece puzzle. One piece missing. Still angry.
- Finished a puzzle. Minus one piece. Furious.
- Puzzle done. One missing. Unacceptable.
- I started learning chess. The club president beat me in six moves. Six.
- Started chess. Lost in six moves. Six.
- Chess. Six moves. I lost.
- Learning chess. Humbling.
- I reorganized my whole room by color. It's very satisfying. Don't judge.
- Organized my room by color. Satisfying.
- Color-coded my room. Don't judge.
- Room by color. Peaceful.
- I tried cooking dinner for my family. They were very... polite.
- Cooked for my family. They were polite.
- Made dinner. Polite reactions.
- I cooked. They were... kind.
- The library got the new volume of the series I like. I reserved it the second I saw it.
- New volume at the library. Reserved instantly.
- The library got my series. Reserved.
- New volume in. I claimed it.

@rule everyday.anecdote.teasing
on everyday
when s=anecdote tone=teasing
- A first-year asked me for directions and I sent him to the faculty room on purpose. He'll thank me later.
- Sent a first-year to the faculty room on purpose. He'll thank me.
- Gave a newbie wrong directions. Character building.
- Misled a first-year. Educational.
- I convinced the cafeteria lady to give me extra karaage. Charm is a skill.
- Extra karaage from the lunch lady. Charm.
- Charmed my way to extra karaage.
- Free karaage. I'm irresistible.
- I saw a cat wearing a tiny sweater on the way here. My day peaked at 7 a.m.
- Cat in a sweater this morning. Peak day.
- Saw a cat in a sweater. Day peaked early.
- A sweatered cat. Nothing tops that.
- I've been writing a story. No, you can't read it. ...Maybe later.
- Writing a story. No, you can't read it. Yet.
- A story. Secret. ...Maybe someday.
- I write. You can't see it. Maybe later.
- I dyed a streak of my hair last weekend. Nobody noticed. Do you?
- Dyed my hair. Nobody noticed. Do you?
- New hair streak. See it?
- Notice anything? My hair?
- I've been people-watching in the courtyard. You'd be amazed what you learn.
- People-watching in the courtyard. Educational.
- Watching people. You learn things.
- The courtyard is full of secrets.

# ================= She has no news =================
@rule everyday.nothing.gentle
on everyday
when s=nothing tone=gentle
- Hmm... I can't think of anything new, sorry.
- Sorry, nothing new comes to mind.
- Hmm... I'm out of news.
- Nothing new, sorry...

@rule everyday.nothing.energetic
on everyday
when s=nothing tone=energetic
- Ehh, nothing's happening! Boring day!
- Nothing's happening! Boring!
- No news! Lame!
- Zero news today!

@rule everyday.nothing.cool
on everyday
when s=nothing tone=cool
- Nothing worth mentioning.
- Nothing to report.
- Nothing new.
- No news.

@rule everyday.nothing.teasing
on everyday
when s=nothing tone=teasing
- You've heard all my stories today.
- You've heard everything today.
- Stories all used up.
- That's all I've got.

# ================= After she vented =================
@rule everyday.vent.thanks.gentle
on everyday
when s=vent.thanks tone=gentle
- ...I feel lighter now. Thank you.
- ...I feel better. Thank you.
- ...That helped so much.
- ...Lighter now. Thanks.

@rule everyday.vent.thanks.energetic
on everyday
when s=vent.thanks tone=energetic
- Okay! I feel way better! You're like a human stress ball!
- Way better! Human stress ball!
- I feel great now! Thanks!
- Better! You're magic!

@rule everyday.vent.thanks.cool
on everyday
when s=vent.thanks tone=cool
- That helped. Don't tell anyone I said that.
- That helped. Keep it secret.
- Useful. Don't tell.
- Helped. Between us.

@rule everyday.vent.thanks.teasing
on everyday
when s=vent.thanks tone=teasing
- You're surprisingly good at this.
- You're good at this. Surprising.
- Not bad at this.
- Surprisingly helpful.

# ================= Your joke worked =================
@rule everyday.joke.good.gentle
on everyday
when s=joke.good tone=gentle
- Pfft... ahaha! That's so silly!
- Pfft... hehe! So silly!
- Ahaha! That's ridiculous!
- Hehehe! Stop!
- Hehe... you're funny.
- Hehe... funny.
- You're so funny...
- Ehehe... good one.
- Ahaha... I'm going to think about that all day.
- I'll think about that all day... hehe.
- Ahaha... that'll stay with me.
- Hehe... I'll remember that.

@rule everyday.joke.good.energetic
on everyday
when s=joke.good tone=energetic
- AHAHA! Stop, stop, my stomach!
- AHAHA! My stomach!
- BWAHAHA! Stop!
- Hahaha! I can't breathe!
- Hahaha! Tell me another!
- Another! Another!
- Hahaha! More!
- Encore!
- Pfffft! You're the best!
- Pffft! Best!
- HA! Love it!
- You're hilarious!

@rule everyday.joke.good.cool
on everyday
when s=joke.good tone=cool
- ...Heh. Okay, that one was good.
- ...Heh. Good one.
- ...Pfft. Okay.
- ...That got me.
- I didn't expect to laugh. Well done.
- Unexpected laugh. Good.
- ...I laughed. Well done.
- Not bad.
- Heh. Not bad at all.
- Heh. Good.
- ...Decent.

@rule everyday.joke.good.teasing
on everyday
when s=joke.good tone=teasing
- Ugh, that's terrible. *snort* Dammit.
- Terrible. *snort* Ugh.
- Awful. *giggle* Damn.
- So bad. ...Heh. Dammit.
- Fine. I laughed. Happy?
- I laughed. Satisfied?
- Fine. Funny.
- Okay. Ha.
- Okay, okay, you win this round.
- You win this round.
- Fine. Point to you.
- Okay. You got me.

# ================= Your joke fell flat =================
@rule everyday.joke.bad.gentle
on everyday
when s=joke.bad tone=gentle
- Um... hehe...? Sorry, I don't think I got it.
- Um... hehe? I didn't get it.
- Ah... sorry, I don't understand.
- Hehe...? Was that a joke?
- Oh... um, that's... nice.
- Oh... that's... nice.
- Um... okay...
- Ah... hehe...

@rule everyday.joke.bad.energetic
on everyday
when s=joke.bad tone=energetic
- ...Was that the joke?
- ...That's it?
- Wait, that was the joke?
- ...Huh?
- Booo! Get off the stage!
- Booo!
- Boo! Get off!
- Lame!

@rule everyday.joke.bad.cool
on everyday
when s=joke.bad tone=cool
- ...
- ...Hm.
- ...No.
- I'll pretend you didn't say that.
- I didn't hear that.
- Ignoring that.
- Forgotten.

@rule everyday.joke.bad.teasing
on everyday
when s=joke.bad tone=teasing
- Wow. That was painful. For both of us.
- Painful. For everyone.
- Ouch. That hurt us both.
- Yikes.
- Did that sound funny in your head?
- Funny in your head?
- That sounded better in your mind, right?
- Did you test that?

# ================= Your joke hurt her =================
@rule everyday.joke.hurt.gentle
on everyday
when s=joke.hurt tone=gentle
- That's... kind of mean, isn't it?
- That's a bit mean...
- Isn't that unkind...?
- That wasn't nice...

@rule everyday.joke.hurt.energetic
on everyday
when s=joke.hurt tone=energetic
- Hey! Not funny!
- Not funny!
- Hey! Mean!
- Rude!

@rule everyday.joke.hurt.cool
on everyday
when s=joke.hurt tone=cool
- That crossed a line.
- Over the line.
- Too far.
- That's not okay.

@rule everyday.joke.hurt.teasing
on everyday
when s=joke.hurt tone=teasing
- Careful. That one stung.
- That stung. Careful.
- Watch it.
- Ouch. Careful.

# ================= She believes your explanation =================
@rule everyday.explain.ok.gentle
on everyday
when s=explain.ok tone=gentle
- Oh... I see. I'm sorry I doubted you.
- Oh... I'm sorry I doubted you.
- I see... sorry.
- Ah... forgive me.

@rule everyday.explain.ok.energetic
on everyday
when s=explain.ok tone=energetic
- Ohhh! Okay, that makes sense! My bad!
- Ohh! Makes sense! My bad!
- Oh! Okay! Sorry!
- Got it! Oops!

@rule everyday.explain.ok.cool
on everyday
when s=explain.ok tone=cool
- ...Fine. That's reasonable.
- ...Reasonable.
- ...Fine.
- ...Acceptable.

@rule everyday.explain.ok.teasing
on everyday
when s=explain.ok tone=teasing
- Hmph. Fine. I'll let it slide. This time.
- Fine. This time.
- I'll allow it. Once.
- Hmph. Pass. Once.

# ================= She does not =================
@rule everyday.explain.fail.gentle
on everyday
when s=explain.fail tone=gentle
- I... I don't know if I believe that.
- I don't know if I believe you...
- Hmm... really...?
- I'm not sure...

@rule everyday.explain.fail.energetic
on everyday
when s=explain.fail tone=energetic
- Uh-huh. Sure. Totally.
- Uh-huh. Sure.
- Riiight.
- Totally. Not.

@rule everyday.explain.fail.cool
on everyday
when s=explain.fail tone=cool
- That's not convincing.
- Unconvincing.
- Not persuasive.
- Weak.

@rule everyday.explain.fail.teasing
on everyday
when s=explain.fail tone=teasing
- Do you hear yourself?
- Listen to yourself.
- Really? That's it?
- Come on.

# ================= She takes your apology =================
@rule everyday.apology.gentle
on everyday
when s=apology tone=gentle
- ...Okay. Thank you for saying that.
- ...Okay. Thank you.
- ...I forgive you.
- ...Thanks for saying sorry.

@rule everyday.apology.energetic
on everyday
when s=apology tone=energetic
- Okay, okay! Apology accepted! Just don't do it again!
- Accepted! Don't do it again!
- Okay! Forgiven!
- Fine! Apology accepted!

@rule everyday.apology.cool
on everyday
when s=apology tone=cool
- Fine. Apology accepted.
- Accepted.
- Fine.
- Apology noted.

@rule everyday.apology.teasing
on everyday
when s=apology tone=teasing
- Hmph. You owe me one.
- You owe me.
- Hmph. Owed.
- One favor. Owed.

# ================= You promise her time together =================
@rule everyday.plans.gentle
on everyday
when s=plans tone=gentle
- Really? Then... I'll be looking forward to it.
- Really? I'll look forward to it.
- Then I'll wait for it...
- Okay... I can't wait.

@rule everyday.plans.energetic
on everyday
when s=plans tone=energetic
- Promise?! Okay! Lunch together sometime!
- Promise?! Lunch together!
- Okay! Lunch date!
- Yay! Promise!

@rule everyday.plans.cool
on everyday
when s=plans tone=cool
- ...Okay. I'll hold you to that.
- ...Holding you to it.
- ...Okay. Noted.
- ...I'll remember.

@rule everyday.plans.teasing
on everyday
when s=plans tone=teasing
- You'd better mean it.
- Mean it.
- You'd better.
- Don't lie.

# ================= she vents =================
@rule everyday.vent.stressed.gentle
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=stressed tone=gentle
- It's the exams... Everyone expects so much and I don't want to disappoint anyone. Sorry, I'm just dumping this on you.
- Exams... everyone expects so much. I'm scared to disappoint them. Sorry for unloading this.
- The tests are close and everyone's counting on me... sorry, I needed to say it.
- I'm so afraid of letting everyone down... sorry for dumping it on you.

@rule everyday.vent.stressed.energetic
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=stressed tone=energetic
- Everything's piling up! Assignments, club, my mom... I just wanna scream into a pillow!
- Assignments, club, mom... too much! I wanna scream!
- Everything's stacking up! I need a pillow to yell into!
- Too much stuff! My head's exploding!

@rule everyday.vent.stressed.cool
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=stressed tone=cool
- I have three deadlines this week and the professor added a fourth. I'm handling it. I just needed to say it out loud.
- Three deadlines, now four. I'm handling it. Just venting.
- Four deadlines this week. Manageable. I needed to say it.
- An extra deadline appeared. I'll manage. Venting.

@rule everyday.vent.stressed.teasing
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=stressed tone=teasing
- Everyone wants something from me today. You're the first person who just... listened.
- Everyone wants something today. You just listened.
- All day, demands. You're the only one who listened.
- Everyone needs me. You just... heard me out.

@rule everyday.vent.upset.gentle
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=upset tone=gentle
- I had a fight with a friend... I said something I didn't mean. Thank you for listening.
- I fought with a friend... I said something cruel. Thanks for listening.
- I hurt a friend's feelings... thank you for hearing me.
- I said something I regret... thanks for listening.

@rule everyday.vent.upset.energetic
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=upset tone=energetic
- Someone said something really mean about me and everyone laughed. Ugh. Thanks for not laughing.
- Someone mocked me and everyone laughed. Thanks for not laughing.
- People laughed at me today. Thanks for being different.
- Someone was mean and everybody laughed. Ugh. Thanks.

@rule everyday.vent.upset.cool
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=upset tone=cool
- A bad day. Things didn't go how I planned. ...Thanks for hearing me out.
- Plans went wrong. ...Thanks for listening.
- Bad day. ...Thanks for hearing it.
- Not my day. ...Thank you.

@rule everyday.vent.upset.teasing
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=upset tone=teasing
- Fine, you want to know? Someone stood me up. There. Happy? ...Thanks, I guess.
- Someone stood me up. Happy? ...Thanks.
- I got stood up. There. ...Thanks, I suppose.
- Stood up. Fine. ...Thanks.

@rule everyday.vent.lonely.gentle
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=lonely tone=gentle
- Sometimes it feels like nobody would notice if I weren't here... Sorry. That's a gloomy thing to say.
- Sometimes I think no one would notice if I disappeared... sorry. Gloomy.
- I feel invisible lately... sorry for saying that.
- Nobody seems to notice me... sorry, that's sad.

@rule everyday.vent.lonely.energetic
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=lonely tone=energetic
- Everyone's got plans except me lately! It's kinda sad, right? Hehe...
- Everyone has plans but me! Sad, right? Hehe...
- Nobody invites me lately! Hehe... sad.
- All my friends are busy! Hehe... lonely.

@rule everyday.vent.lonely.cool
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=lonely tone=cool
- My friends have been busy. It's quieter than I'd like.
- My friends are busy. It's too quiet.
- Quieter than I'd like lately.
- My friends are occupied. Quiet days.

@rule everyday.vent.lonely.teasing
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=lonely tone=teasing
- Don't laugh, but I've been eating lunch alone all week.
- Don't laugh. I've eaten alone all week.
- Lunch alone all week. Don't laugh.
- Solo lunches. All week. Laugh and die.

@rule everyday.vent.other.gentle
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=other tone=gentle
- I'm just tired lately. Thank you for listening.
- I'm just tired. Thanks for listening.
- Just tired... thank you.
- So tired lately... thanks.

@rule everyday.vent.other.energetic
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=other tone=energetic
- Ugh, today was SO long!
- Today was SO long!
- Ugh, endless day!
- Longest day ever!

@rule everyday.vent.other.cool
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=other tone=cool
- It's been a long week.
- Long week.
- A tiring week.
- The week dragged.

@rule everyday.vent.other.teasing
on everyday
when s=vent vmood=other tone=teasing
- Life's being annoying. That's all.
- Life's annoying. That's all.
- Just annoyed with life.
- Everything's irritating.

# ================= what people say about you =================
@rule everyday.rep.high.gentle
on everyday
when s=rep trep=high tone=gentle
- Everyone says you're really kind. I think so too.
- Everyone thinks you're kind. Me too.
- People say you're so nice... I agree.
- You're known as kind. It's true.

@rule everyday.rep.high.energetic
on everyday
when s=rep trep=high tone=energetic
- You're kinda famous! Everyone likes you!
- You're famous! Everyone loves you!
- Popular guy! Everyone likes you!
- You're a celebrity!

@rule everyday.rep.high.cool
on everyday
when s=rep trep=high tone=cool
- You have a good reputation. Don't waste it.
- Good reputation. Keep it.
- People respect you. Don't ruin it.
- Well regarded. Maintain it.

@rule everyday.rep.high.teasing
on everyday
when s=rep trep=high tone=teasing
- You're popular, you know. It's a little annoying.
- Popular. Slightly irritating.
- Everyone likes you. Annoying.
- You're liked. How tiresome.

@rule everyday.rep.good.gentle
on everyday
when s=rep trep=good tone=gentle
- People think you're nice, I think.
- People like you, I think.
- You seem well liked...
- I think people think well of you.

@rule everyday.rep.good.energetic
on everyday
when s=rep trep=good tone=energetic
- People like you! Mostly!
- You're liked! Kinda!
- Most people dig you!

@rule everyday.rep.good.cool
on everyday
when s=rep trep=good tone=cool
- People don't mind you.
- Tolerated.
- People are fine with you.
- Acceptable reputation.

@rule everyday.rep.good.teasing
on everyday
when s=rep trep=good tone=teasing
- You're... known. In a good way. Mostly.
- Known. Nicely. Mostly.
- A decent reputation. Sort of.
- Not bad. Not great.

@rule everyday.rep.low.gentle
on everyday
when s=rep trep=low tone=gentle
- Um, not everyone knows you yet.
- Not everyone knows you yet...
- Some people don't know you...
- You're still new to many...

@rule everyday.rep.low.energetic
on everyday
when s=rep trep=low tone=energetic
- Half the class doesn't know your name! Haha!
- Half the class doesn't know you! Ha!
- Who? Haha! Kidding! Sorta!
- Nobody knows your name! Haha!

@rule everyday.rep.low.cool
on everyday
when s=rep trep=low tone=cool
- You're not very well known.
- Not widely known.
- Low profile.
- Few know you.

@rule everyday.rep.low.teasing
on everyday
when s=rep trep=low tone=teasing
- You're a bit of a mystery. Not the cool kind.
- Mysterious. Not cool mysterious.
- An unknown. Not intriguing.
- A mystery. A boring one.

@rule everyday.rep.bad.gentle
on everyday
when s=rep trep=bad tone=gentle
- Some people say... strange things about you. I don't believe them!
- People say strange things... I don't believe them!
- There are odd rumors... but I trust you!
- Some say bad things... I don't buy it!

@rule everyday.rep.bad.energetic
on everyday
when s=rep trep=bad tone=energetic
- People are saying weird stuff about you, dude.
- People say weird stuff about you!
- Dude, weird rumors!
- Your rep's kinda weird, man!

@rule everyday.rep.bad.cool
on everyday
when s=rep trep=bad tone=cool
- Your reputation is poor. Work on it.
- Poor reputation. Fix it.
- Bad standing. Improve.
- Your reputation needs work.

@rule everyday.rep.bad.teasing
on everyday
when s=rep trep=bad tone=teasing
- Your reputation is in the gutter. Impressive, really.
- Gutter reputation. Impressive.
- Your rep is trash. Wow.
- Rock-bottom reputation. Remarkable.

# ================= you caught her out: you promise to keep it, or you tease =================
@rule everyday.secret.keep.gentle
on everyday
when s=secret secret=keep tone=gentle
- Thank you... I really owe you one.
- Thank you... I owe you.
- Thanks so much...
- I'm in your debt...

@rule everyday.secret.keep.energetic
on everyday
when s=secret secret=keep tone=energetic
- You're a lifesaver! Our secret, okay?!
- Lifesaver! Secret!
- Our secret! Thanks!
- You rock! Shh!

@rule everyday.secret.keep.cool
on everyday
when s=secret secret=keep tone=cool
- Good. ...Thanks.
- ...Thank you.
- ...Appreciated.

@rule everyday.secret.keep.teasing
on everyday
when s=secret secret=keep tone=teasing
- Smart choice. I'll remember this.
- Smart. I'll remember.
- Wise choice.
- Good. Noted.

@rule everyday.secret.tease.gentle
on everyday
when s=secret secret=tease tone=gentle
- You're so mean...!
- So mean...!
- You're cruel...!
- How could you...!

@rule everyday.secret.tease.energetic
on everyday
when s=secret secret=tease tone=energetic
- Noooo! You wouldn't!
- No! You wouldn't!
- Don't you dare!
- Nooo!

@rule everyday.secret.tease.cool
on everyday
when s=secret secret=tease tone=cool
- Not funny.
- Stop.
- Unamusing.

@rule everyday.secret.tease.teasing
on everyday
when s=secret secret=tease tone=teasing
- Try it and see what happens.
- Try it. See.
- Go ahead. I dare you.
- Do it and regret it.

# ================= a topic she liked =================
@rule everyday.topic.classes.gentle
on everyday
when s=topic gtopic=classes tone=gentle
- Classes are going well! I finally understood today's math lesson.
- Classes are fine! I even understood math today.
- I've been keeping up in class. The professor was really kind today.
- Campus is going well, I think! I got a good grade on a quiz.

