on everyday
when s=topic gtopic=classes tone=energetic
- Classes? Ugh. But okay, history was actually kinda cool today!
- Ugh, classes! But PE was awesome today!
- Class is class, but history had a cool story today!
- Honestly? Science was fun! We blew something up! Kinda!

@rule everyday.topic.classes.cool
on everyday
when s=topic gtopic=classes tone=cool
- Fine. I like it when a professor actually explains things properly.
- Classes are tolerable. Today's lecture was well structured.
- Good. I appreciate a professor who prepares.
- Productive. I understood everything.

@rule everyday.topic.classes.teasing
on everyday
when s=topic gtopic=classes tone=teasing
- I aced the quiz. Go on, be impressed.
- Top of the class, as usual. You may applaud.
- I answered every question today. Jealous?
- Classes? Easy. Next question.

@rule everyday.topic.club.gentle
on everyday
when s=topic gtopic=club tone=gentle
