# The opening question follows the topic the player chose.
@rule me.opener.classes
on me.opener
when topic=classes
- How are classes going for you?
- Did you get today's assignments?
- Which class has been keeping you busiest lately?

@rule me.opener.club
on me.opener
when topic=club
- How's your club doing lately?
- Anything new at your club?
- What have you been working on with the club?

@rule me.opener.food
on me.opener
when topic=food
- Had anything good to eat today?
- What's your favorite thing at the cafeteria?
- Have you found a new favorite meal lately?

@rule me.opener.sports
on me.opener
when topic=sports
- Do you follow any sports?
- Do you work out at all?
- What sport do you enjoy watching or playing?

@rule me.opener.hobbies
on me.opener
when topic=hobbies
- What do you do in your free time?
- Into anything fun lately?
- Have you picked up any new hobbies?

@rule me.opener.rumors
on me.opener
when topic=rumors
- Heard any interesting rumors around campus?
- Do you know what everyone's whispering about?
- Has anything unusual been going around campus?

@rule me.opener.weekend
on me.opener
when topic=weekend
- Got any plans for the weekend?
- Did you do anything fun last weekend?
- Is there something you'd like to do this weekend?

@rule me.opener.love
on me.opener
when topic=love
- So... is there anyone you like?
